      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "heading": "公司層",
          "body": [
            "等權分散可以降低單一公司起伏，但不能保證整體組合低風險。"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "heading": "分散真正做到的事",
          "body": [
            {
              "template": "個股年化波動中位數為 {single_vol}，全名冊等權後降至 {portfolio_vol}。",
              "bindings": {
                "single_vol": {
                  "source": "main",
                  "path": "diversification_summary.median_individual_annualized_volatility",
                  "format": {
                    "kind": "percent",
                    "digits": 1
                  }
                },
                "portfolio_vol": {
                  "source": "main",
                  "path": "diversification_summary.all_29_annualized_volatility",
                  "format": {
                    "kind": "percent",
                    "digits": 1
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "heading": "題材層",
          "body": [
            {
              "template": "核心組合的平均兩兩相關係數為 {correlation}；共同熱度上升時，持股增加不等於風險來源增加。",
              "bindings": {
                "correlation": {
                  "source": "main",
                  "path": "portfolio_comparison.core_6_equal.average_pairwise_correlation",
                  "format": {
                    "kind": "percent",
                    "digits": 1
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "heading": "政策與訂單層",
          "body": [
